=== ANSWER W ===
**There were 53 Sundays in 2023.** The colleague's answer is correct.

January 1, 2023 was a Sunday. The year had 365 days, which is 52 weeks plus 1 day. That extra day is December 31, which was also a Sunday. So the first and last days of the year were both Sundays, giving 52 + 1 = 53.

